# Full-size original photos — keep these local; the site serves optimized copies
# (e.g. bev-portrait.jpg). Drop new originals here freely without bloating the repo.
# Leading slash = repo root only, so a card photo named cover.png still commits.
/Bev.png
/cover.png

# Logs / temp
*.log
.tmp/
